1 REM FBCS PRG-0064
2 REM CLAIM A-4.4.4-07
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
100 REM Parameter SIN of internal FUNCTION F has scope F only: outside, SIN(0) is the
110 REM supplied function (4.4.4 l.1511-1518)
120 DECLARE FUNCTION F
